ati, frutta fresca, yogurt, prodotti dell'acetaia. E poi caffe, cappuccino, succhi, te. La colazione e inclusa nel soggiorno - ma la vista non ha prezzo.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Orario buffet\",{\"className\":\"bg-sol-sand p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-bark/40\",\"children\":\"Orario buffet\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-bark\",\"children\":\"8:00 – 10:00\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Prodotti\",{\"className\":\"bg-sol-sand p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-bark/40\",\"children\":\"Prodotti\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-bark\",\"children\":\"Freschi e locali\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Senza glutine\",{\"className\":\"bg-sol-sand p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-bark/40\",\"children\":\"Senza glutine\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-bark\",\"children\":\"Disponibile\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Senza lattosio\",{\"className\":\"bg-sol-sand p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-bark/40\",\"children\":\"Senza lattosio\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-bark\",\"children\":\"Disponibile\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 font-sans text-xs italic text-sol-bark/50\",\"children\":\"Prodotti senza glutine e latte vegetale disponibili su richiesta.\"}]]}]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"id\":\"eventi\",\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-0 bg-sol-mist md:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-[400px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"images\":[{\"src\":\"/images/services/eventi.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Event